*suiminyaku

[bg  time="1000"  method="crossfade"  storage="black.jpg"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
Shinya "...I did get those sleeping pills. Time to put them to use."[p]
Shinya "Crush it up fine so she doesn't notice, and then mix it into a drink in her fridge."[p]
Shinya "All right, I should get some good footage out of this. Looking forward to tonight."[p]
[_tb_end_text]

